\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Precision against recall of supported triples on \textsc  {Biotx100} (three seeds). The dashed curve is the per-component oracle bound $65r/(65r+16)$ of \S  \ref  {sec:decomp}: a verifier with perfect knowledge of both taxa and the relation still admits all 16 pair-binding failures at every operating point. The deployed filter falls below it. The verifier is a curve, not a point, and its 91-candidate operating point coincides with the deployed filter's confusion matrix.\relax }}{5}{figure.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:curve}{{2}{5}{Precision against recall of supported triples on \textsc {Biotx100} (three seeds). The dashed curve is the per-component oracle bound $65r/(65r+16)$ of \S \ref {sec:decomp}: a verifier with perfect knowledge of both taxa and the relation still admits all 16 pair-binding failures at every operating point. The deployed filter falls below it. The verifier is a curve, not a point, and its 91-candidate operating point coincides with the deployed filter's confusion matrix.\relax }{figure.caption.14}{}}
